{"name":"Gravlax","hex":"#ec834f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gravlax","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Salmon dry-cured in salt, seasoned with dill and sugar, and served usually thinly sliced as an appetizer."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gravlax"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gravlax","blocks":[{"text":"Gravlax, graavilohi, gravad lax, gravlaks or graved salmon is a Nordic dish consisting of salmon that is cured using a mix of salt, sugar and dill. It is garnished with fresh dill or spruce twigs and may occasionally be cold-smoked after it is cured. Gravlax is usually served as an appetizer, sliced thinly and accompanied by a dill and mustard sauce known as hovmästarsås, either on bread or with boiled potatoes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Laxr%C3%A4tter.jpg/330px-Laxr%C3%A4tter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gravlax","wikidata":"Q252630"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg/500px-Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg/1280px-Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg/500px-Gravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gravlax with hovmästarsås (a mustard and dill sauce)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGravlax_med_hovm%C3%A4stars%C3%A5s.jpg"}],"sounds":{"gravlax":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-gravlax.wav?utm_source=e